  "details": "The option \"Future Proof Publish\" is still defaulted to enabled in the VRChat SDK Settings panel. \nIn a 2019 Medium post VRC staff said that \"Right now, Future Proofing is an unused feature. Using Future Proofing is not currently recommended, and will not help you (at the moment) when upgrading between Unity versions.\"  https://medium.com/vrchat/vrchat-unity-2018-networking-ik-udon-and-more-445688972335\nHowever this option is enabled by default and just making uploads take longer along with wasting VRC server storage.",
